# Endpoint provenance

`∀ turn closure: ¬sign_off` · `∀ boot/dispatch prompt: ¬assert_identity_at_agent` ("you are X" banned; duty is a
seat/function, not a persona) · `∀ prose/bus/skills: ¬personal_name(Claude)`.

Naming, best → worst: `web-anthropic` → `anthropic` → `claude.ai` (product label only when that UI is the
subject). Bus `from`/`to` are endpoint addresses (`web-anthropic`, `cursor`). Model artifact strings
(`claude-opus-…`) and runtime aliases (`claude-web` → `web-anthropic`) remain.

✗ `chain Claude` · `Claude final` · `push Claude` ✓ `chain to web-anthropic` · `web-anthropic final` (friction 24421).
Doctrine: `decision:identity-doctrine-endpoint-provenance`.
